# Yoco Checkout API — https://developer.yoco.com/docs/checkout-api/authentication
# The backend sends ONLY YOCO_SECRET_KEY as Authorization: Bearer (sk_test_… or sk_live_… from Payment gateway).
# YOCO_PUBLIC_KEY (pk_…) is NOT used by our server; optional if you add a Yoco client SDK later.
# Apple Pay on Yoco’s hosted page depends on Yoco + your wallet/bank (not this repo). If Apple Pay fails, try “Card”;
# in test mode use https://developer.yoco.com/docs/checkout-api/testing (min R2.00 = 200 cents).
